{"unit_id":"kingofpowers__dsh-chat-ctxmenu#caveat-1","repo":"kingofpowers/dsh-chat-ctxmenu","commit":"44721b722bc5215d6f8e08af29762d59c9d0f5c9","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-chat-ctxmenu 的文件路径解析和打开应用依赖 DSH Host 的文件系统及桌面服务；只有工作区内路径能提供相对路径，正文路径需先通过 Host 校验。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:245-285","index.js:402-460"]}
